;- after first layer -
M104 S220 T0
M140 S90 ; wait for bed temp
;- after first layer -
;========================
; - END OF ZCHUNK #1, range=[0.15, 0.15] -
;========================
;========================
; - START OF ZCHUNK #2, range=[0.15, 0.15] -
;========================
