;- START OF Fiber STRETCH INITIALIZATION -
G10 S1
; nozzle change gcode for switching from the polymer nozzle(T1) to the fiber guide (T0)
M104 S50 T1 ; cool down polymer nozzle
G10
G91 ; use relative coordinates
